OL,3,GNEWSADrugs worth more than #1.4m
OL,4,Arecovered by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrugs worth more than #1.4m have been
OL,7,Frecovered in Edinburgh and West
OL,8,FLothian, police have said.
OL,10,FOfficers executed warrants at addresses
OL,11,Fin the Leith, Granton and Uphall areas
OL,12,Fon Tuesday.
OL,14,FPolice Scotland said cannabis, cocaine
OL,15,Fand a six-figure sum of money was
OL,16,Fseized.
