OL,3,GNEWSADrugs worth more than #1.4m
OL,4,Arecovered by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men aged 37 and 62 were arrested
OL,7,Fand charged, and are due to appear at
OL,8,FEdinburgh Sheriff Court at a later
OL,9,Fdate. A 52-year-old man was arrested
OL,10,Fand released pending further
OL,11,Finvestigation.
